Package: pulsaros-airpods
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Victor Rosario <hello@victorrosario.dev>
Depends: gnome-shell, pulsaros-librepods
Description: AirPods in the GNOME top bar for Pulsar OS.
 A GNOME Shell extension (airpods@pulsaros.org) that shows an AirPods icon while
 they are connected, like macOS, with the battery of each earbud and the case,
 the listening mode (Noise Cancellation, Transparency, Adaptive, Off where the
 model has it), Conversation Awareness, One-Bud ANC and ear detection. It reads
 the state published by the pulsaros-librepods daemon. Supports GNOME Shell 48
 and 51.
